{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fracture Point</strong> is a fast-paced roguelike looter shooter in first-person perspective, set in a realistic dystopian metropolis engulfed in a war between a powerful corporation and the resistance. After years of imprisonment, you return to join the resistance, with only one way forward - ascending through the many floors of a heavily guarded skyscraper to reach the corporation's leader and take your revenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear floors of armed enemies, gather weapons, armor, and rare items. Sell your loot at the base, upgrade your gear, and prepare for the next fight. But be careful - death is permanent, and you can lose everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you survive the tower and fulfill your vengeance?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560110/extras/28ba5208be1a4b39499eba21c0802d35.poster.avif?t=1761143802\" width=600 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560110/extras/28ba5208be1a4b39499eba21c0802d35.webm?t=1761143802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560110/extras/28ba5208be1a4b39499eba21c0802d35.mp4?t=1761143802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run through the tower is a unique challenge. Procedurally generated floors with diverse layouts, numerous enemies, a variety of loot, and different interaction points\u2014ATMs, currency exchanges, vending machines, and loot collectors \u2014 define your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Managing your equipment is crucial - every piece matters. Each weapon has magazines that need to be manually filled with ammo. As you fight through enemy-filled floors, the risks increase: loot becomes more valuable, but so do the threats. Will you return to base, sacrificing all your progress, or risk everything to climb higher? Your fate is in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560110/extras/0b42e1580a0efc7176b464e0db9918ab.poster.avif?t=1761143802\" width=600 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560110/extras/0b42e1580a0efc7176b464e0db9918ab.webm?t=1761143802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560110/extras/0b42e1580a0efc7176b464e0db9918ab.mp4?t=1761143802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're not just another mercenary looking for profit - your mission is personal. Years ago, the city's ruling corporation betrayed you and sent you to prison. Their leader erased your past, destroyed your friends, and left you to rot behind bars. Now you're back, and with the resistance at your side, you have the weapons and the means to fight your way to the top. Floor by floor, you take down his soldiers and loyalists while he watches your every move, sending deadlier assassins after you, preparing for the final confrontation. But you won\u2019t stop until you see his dead body.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560110/extras/d4298500390662108771330d8f128e71.poster.avif?t=1761143802\" width=600 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560110/extras/d4298500390662108771330d8f128e71.webm?t=1761143802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560110/extras/d4298500390662108771330d8f128e71.mp4?t=1761143802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WEAPONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have access to a vast arsenal - ranging from handguns to assault rifles, with a variety of ammo calibers and magazines for each weapon. Find, upgrade, and adapt your loadout to suit your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560110/extras/de7e62a4d5c8c4a020593cb05b979696.poster.avif?t=1761143802\" width=600 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560110/extras/de7e62a4d5c8c4a020593cb05b979696.webm?t=1761143802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560110/extras/de7e62a4d5c8c4a020593cb05b979696.mp4?t=1761143802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3560110?t=1761143802","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3560110?t=1761143802","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560110/69f1faea49a742dc177ed23ac500aab7e19f438f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761143802","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560110/69f1faea49a742dc177ed23ac500aab7e19f438f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761143802","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_de