ough enemy-filled floors, the risks increase: loot becomes more valuable, but so do the threats. Will you return to base, sacrificing all your progress, or risk everything to climb higher? Your fate is in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560110/extras/0b42e1580a0efc7176b464e0db9918ab.poster.avif?t=1761143802\" width=600 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560110/extras/0b42e1580a0efc7176b464e0db9918ab.webm?t=1761143802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560110/extras/0b42e1580a0efc7176b464e0db9918ab.mp4?t=1761143802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're not just another mercenary looking for profit - your mission is personal. Years ago, the city's ruling corporation betrayed you and sent you to prison. Their leader erased your past, destroyed your friends, and left you to rot behind bars. Now you're back, and with the resistance at your side, you have the weapons and the means to fight your way to the top. Floor by floor, you take down his soldiers and loyalists while he watches your every move, sending deadlier assassins after you, preparing for the final confrontation. But you won\u2019t stop until you see his dead body.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560110/extras/d4298500390662108771330d8f128e71.poster.avif?t=1761143802\" width=600 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560110/extras/d4298500390662108771330d8f128e71.webm?t=1761143802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560110/extras/d4298500390662108771330d8f128e71.mp4?t=1761143802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WEAPONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have access to a vast arsenal - ranging from handguns to assault rifles, with a variety of ammo calibers and magazines for each weapon. Find, upgrade, and adapt your loadout to suit your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560110/extras/de7e62a4d5c8c4a020593cb05b979696.poster.avif?t=1761143802\" width=600 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560110/extras/de7e62a4d5c8c4a020593cb05b979696.webm?t=1761143802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560110/extras/de7e62a4d5c8c4a020593cb05b979696.mp4?t=1761143802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Burlaka Kyrylo"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560110/3b7d43a17c25055cfaf7e68d352feeb31cf8c394/header.jpg?t=1761143802","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3560110/850570/de5fcbc69d9a4a